  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Sudan Rural Development Programme (SORUDEV)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The South Sudan Rural Development Programme (SORUDEV) aims at improving food security in four States of South Sudan using a three pronged approach: (1) improving the States&apos; food security policy implementation and strategic planning capacity, (2) increasing the agricultural production of rural smallholders and (3) facilitating the access of smallholders&apos; agricultural production to markets</narrative>
  </description>
